WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.889
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:05.412
Building Ticket-to-Machine.

3
00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:08.687
This is Chapter 1: the
loop and the typed task.

4
00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:14.288
Every step of Book 13's loop writes or
reads one record, the identity finding.

5
00:00:14.288 --> 00:00:19.312
If its shape is wrong, the clock, the owner
and the re-read are all wrong with it.

6
00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:23.441
We'll place each file of the ServiceNow
and SailPoint kit in the loop,

7
00:00:23.441 --> 00:00:27.791
then check that record on a laptop
before anything reaches ServiceNow,

8
00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:30.224
and finish with two labs and the dangers.

9
00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:33.700
The code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
